s!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51007,"threadID":3858,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1477003909,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1477005818,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Krimz</strong></cite><p>Hey <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/322-bara/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Bara</a> , ich weiß nicht obs nur bei mir so ist. Aber auf&#x27;m Handy ist die Anzeige der Server relativ &quot;dünn&quot; und man hat nicht unbedingt alles auf einem Blick.<br></p></blockquote><p>Bekanntes Problem, zurückzuführen zu Bootstrap 3. Man könnte ein &quot;Workaround&quot; schreiben, allerdings wird es hoffentlich mit Bootstrap 4 von Haus gefixed sein/werden. Daher gab es bei dieser Angelegenheit noch kein Fix von meiner Seite aus.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51009,"threadID":3858,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"","time":1477036554,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Really good idé! makes more things so much better</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51012,"threadID":3858,"userID":1601,"username":"NostalbierHD","subject":"","time":1477048687,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Toll :3</p>","polls":[]}]}